ottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-variant-ligatures: normal;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RibGms1mTJmG2Pz9T4JtrViaN7wWkXdB6yxMYYn5u04ufzrEadu7WaTAPGQzIe2yw32BBwOGzUc6ZQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;'>\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于La Cumparsita\n           <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          La Cumparsita位于卡尔达斯的Chinchina市的\n          <span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n           El Bajo Español小镇，庄园诞生于2022年，由Sebastian Velasquez和他的父亲Carlos Velasquez为了家族的咖啡梦想所创立，种植面积5公倾，庄园种植有8个咖啡品种；Cumparsita是一个非常有代表性的小农家庭，基本所有的运营管理农务都由家里的成员，Sebastian的父母和妻子与他自己四人负责，产季时会请一些附近的一些女性村名帮忙；庄园的名字是由Sebastian的奶奶起的，受他的爷爷年轻时经常往来于南美，对跟踪南美音乐的喜爱也影响了他的奶奶，于是当家里想为这个充满了梦想和爱的农场起名字时，奶奶就把很喜欢的一个音乐名字赋予了它；\n           <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RibGms1mTJmG2Pz9T4JtrViaLSjIUroxib66CluHW5Y8yZ2Zpia3uJYp9wEEh8YnYSosvhiawLe5MhlGw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;text-align: left;'>\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);orphans: 2;text-indent: 8px;widows: 2;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于这个批次的处理方式\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 8px;widows: 2;text-align: left;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n           这个批次使用了自制发酵液Culturing的方式，使用新鲜的菠萝与肉桂皮，打碎后结合酿酒酵母混合后发酵培养菌群，随后参与咖啡鲜果和脱皮后的两段式厌氧发酵\n           <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style='padding-left: 1.5em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;list-style-type: circle;'>\n<li style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 8px;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: justify;\">\n            鲜果采收后浮选，漂出浮果和杂质后，再由人工手选\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-align: left;\">\n<span style='outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;widows: 2;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n            手选后的果子在不锈钢罐里，加入预先准备的发酵液（酵母+菠萝+肉桂混合）厌氧发酵5天，\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-align: left;\">\n<span style='outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;widows: 2;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n            第一个发酵阶段结束后，咖啡果脱皮，同样加入发酵液再一起厌氧发酵2天\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 8px;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: justify;\">\n            发酵结束后，取出咖啡豆在晒棚下晾晒缓慢干燥\n           </span>\n<span style='outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n</span>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RibGms1mTJmG2Pz9T4JtrViaTPib8luXdb4cwhMic9Xw8Gtagw3manaW5rv9xoNcBubOQLiahFfeFjWZw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n          更多咖啡豆选购，请关注收藏小程序和淘宝店铺哦～\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;'>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
